# Stack: Go

Go >= [[ go_version ]] with Go modules: `go` fetches go.mod's toolchain itself (`GOTOOLCHAIN=auto`). Done = code + tests + wiki.

- **Design records:** `docs/design/NNNN-*.md` from `0000-template.md`, a line in its `README.md` index (read only what it names). New feature, dependency or public interface (config keys, CLI, HTTP API, file formats): write one first.
- Never re-propose `TODO.md`'s "Decided against".

## Don't read

`go.sum` (use `go list -m all`), `CHANGELOG.md` (use `git log`), `coverage.out`, `dist/`; generated wiki blocks (`<!-- generated:start/end -->`).

## Commands

| Task | Command |
|---|---|
| Install / add | `go mod download` / `go get <module>`, then `go mod tidy` |
| Lint, format | `golangci-lint run --fix`, `golangci-lint fmt` |
| Vet | `go vet ./...` |
| Tests (80% floor, -race) / integration | `sh scripts/test.sh` / `go test -tags integration ./tests/integration/...` |
| Wiki sections | `go run ./scripts/gen-wiki` |
[% if has_cli %]
| Run | `go run ./cmd/[[ project_name ]] --help` |
[% endif %]

